  "solution": {
    "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msub><mo>∝</mo><msup><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow></msup></math><br />or <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi><msup><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mfenced><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow></msup></msup></math><br />or <math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">log</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">log</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>)</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">log</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow></mrow></math><br />or <math><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math><br />Thus, slope = m = 1 - n<br />or 1 - n = 0<br />So n = 1<br />and for I order reaction <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>0.693</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>.",
